name: Axes First
description: Set the trade-off frame of a decision before generating any candidates, then generate one
  candidate per axis region — each as an option folder in this cell. Guided by the axes-first judgment skill.
tags:
- axes-first
prompt: Run the axes-first skill on the decision this cell's files describe — name the trade-off axes first, then
  generate one candidate per axis region as an option folder in this cell.
settings:
  agent-config.set_yaml:
    surface: annotation
    session: oneshot
    backend: pydantic-ai
    system_prompt: ''
    mcp: 'off'
    approvals: auto
    selected_file_first: false
folders:
- _skills
accounts: {}
permissions:
  docker: none
  internet: full
  commands: deny
packages: {}
